rooms_desc ({"You are in entry hall of Zera's fortress. You can see HUGE towersby the both sides of the main gate.","You are in gate room to zera's fortress.You can also entertowers to the west and to the east.","You are in southwest tower of the Zera's fortress. THe tower was builtto protect the fortress from the enemy, therefore there are manyweapons here.","You are in southeast tower of Zera's fortress. Tower was built toprotect the fortress from enemy, therefore there are many weapons here","You are in central square of Zera's fortress. You can see beautifulmarble fountain in the centre and doors to the livingroom and bedroomto the east and west. To the south is garden","You entered Beautiful garden in Zeras castle. Everythinglooks so quiet that you just wanna stay here forever.In the middle of the garden you see nice bench.Sometime you notice rabbits munching grass and playing at the meadow.",0,0,0,0,})
